{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e39068ec-b1e7-836e-8258-d98726fdf520",
  "created_at": "2026-01-15T11:07:54-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dennis Sullivan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Janet Whitcomb",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:04:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance Department, Janet Whitcomb speaking. How may I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:04:34-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good morning. My name is Dennis Sullivan. I am calling about a parking ticket that I received, and frankly I think it is a little ridiculous."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:04:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry to hear that, Mr. Sullivan. Can you tell me what the ticket was issued for and where?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:04:53-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It was for overnight parking. But the car was in front of my own house. My own house! I pay taxes on the property, and I am told I cannot leave my car at my own curb. On the other hand, I understand rules are rules, but this one seems to be made for tourists, not for the people who live here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:05:16-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Overnight parking restrictions do apply on certain streets regardless of where you live. Do you have the ticket number in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:05:26-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am driving right now, so no, I do not have it in my hand. I just dropped my daughter at a sleepover and I am going home. But I can tell you it was Tuesday night, or really Wednesday morning, very early."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:05:42-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please keep your eyes on the road. We can do this without the number for now. What is it you'd like to do about the ticket?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:05:52-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two things. First, I want a resident permit so this does not happen again. On the other hand, maybe there is no such thing and I am wasting my breath."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:06:04-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a resident parking permit process, but it's handled by a different office. I can transfer you, or I can take your information and have them contact you. Which would you prefer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:06:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Transfer is fine, but if it rings and rings, I will call you back and be even less happy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:06:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Before I do that, what was your second item?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:06:30-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The appeal. I want to appeal this in writing. Where do I send it? On the other hand, I do not want to send it to the wrong place and then be told I missed a deadline."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:06:44-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Written appeals go to the Finance Department at City Hall, attention Parking Violations. That's on Broadway. Be sure to include the ticket number, your license plate, and your reason for the appeal."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:06:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Broadway, attention Parking Violations. And is there a form, or I just write a letter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:07:03-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A letter is acceptable as long as it has those details. The back of the ticket also has instructions, and the deadline is printed there as well, so please check it carefully."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:07:16-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. I will read the back of the ticket, which I should have done before getting upset. On the other hand, the print on those things is the size of an ant."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:07:29-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It can be small, yes. Would you like me to note a callback number in case the permit office doesn't pick up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:07:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0163."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:07:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, 401-555-0163. I'll note that. Please hold while I transfer you, Mr. Sullivan."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T11:07:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I am holding, and also turning onto my street, so if I go quiet, that is why."
    }
  ],
